# Build context for docs/deploy/docker/prod/Dockerfile is the repo root.
# Keep the image free of local secrets, VCS data, and build caches.

.git
.trellis

# Dependencies and build output are recreated inside the image.
**/node_modules
web/.next
**/target

# Local secrets never enter the image, at any depth (compose injects env at runtime).
**/.env*

# Docs and test artifacts are irrelevant to the web build.
docs
test-results
web/test-results
tests/e2e/reports
web/playwright-report*
